# NV-10 — Gui cau hoi

UC: 100-113  
Actors: public user, reception officer  
Status: P0 mocked end-to-end; AI/VNeID integrations mocked.

## Scope

Question entry, topic/unit, evidence upload, preview/confirm, draft/edit/cancel, urgency, similar-question suggestion, identity data, forbidden-content scan, dossier code and due-date notification.

## Acceptance criteria

- Required fields and attachment validation are deterministic and accessible.
- Draft can be edited only before reception; confirmed submit creates one unique dossier code.
- Similar-question and forbidden-content results are advisory and do not silently submit.
- Submit success shows code, expected deadline and notification channel.

## Test mapping

`mock-db.service.spec.ts`, `ask-question.component.spec.ts` (planned extension).

